# Research data: raw/processed/injected payloads NEVER in git (large, or
# derived/reproducible from seeds+injectors) - the raw archive gets an automated
# off-machine backup instead (collector/backup_to_drive.ps1), not git. Acquisition
# metadata (data/metadata.csv, data/static/) DOES go in git per Russo's 2026-08-11
# correction: GitHub is for code and metadata, not the raw archive itself.
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
data/injected/*
data/tmp/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/injected/.gitkeep
data/console.log
data/*_run.log
data/*_run.err.log
data/backup.log

# T37 (04_dose_response_analysis.py) per-experiment worker cache/results -
# scratch, superseded by the aggregated reports/t11_dose_response.csv
reports/t11_partial/*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Environment / secrets
.env
.DS_Store

# private correspondence / session notes - never publish (repo origin is public)
docs/outbox/
# graphify cache
graphify-out/
docs/handoff_archive_*.md
